{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-22 05:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF AMAZON.COM, INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JULY 5, 2022 - (NASDAQ: AMZN)', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF AMAZON.COM, INC.. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF AMZN DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-22 04:01:00', 'title': "STRATEGY ANALYTICS: AMAZON'S RING REMAINED ATOP THE VIDEO DOORBELL MARKET IN 2021", 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IN 2021 AMAZON'S RING SOLD MORE THAN 1.7 MILLION VIDEO DOORBELLS IN 2021 TO EXPAND ITS LEAD ON ITS COMPETITORS AND ENABLE THE COMPANY TO ALL BUT CEMENT ITSELF AT THE TOP OF THE VIDEO DOORBELL MARKET ACCORDING TO STRATEGY ANALYTICS' REPORT, “VIDEO DOORBELL GLOBAL MARKET SHARES – JUNE 2022”. STRATEGY ANALYTICS ESTIMATES THE TOP FIVE VIDEO DOORBELL BRANDS GLOBALLY AS OF THE END OF 2021 ARE, IN ORDER: RING, SKYBELL, GOOGLE'S NEST, SMART HOME PROVIDER VIVINT, AND ADT. THESE"}